{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942","id":3749838805,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7fgf_V","number":1942,"title":"Trae IDE整体卡顿","user":{"login":"arshcaria","id":3211106,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTExMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3211106?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria","html_url":"https://github.com/arshcaria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arshcaria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-12-20T09:19:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T07:17:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"操作系统 Windows 11\nTrae 国际版 3.5.6\n\n用一段时间, Trae IDE整体的任何操作(代码上下滚动/菜单按钮操作等)就会变得卡顿, 流畅度明显下降.\n\n在32核处理器下, 打开任务管理器, 能看到仅仅滚动代码窗口, CPU占用就能达到3% (相当于32核处理器独占一核), 考虑到UI线程是单线程, 这相当于UI线程肯定发生了阻塞, 导致UI整体卡顿.\n\n相比之下vs code或其他code-bsaed IDE, 相同滚动代码窗口操作下的CPU占用仅为1%, 且没有卡顿发生.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1942/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}